msgid "Pixonaut could not be searched. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "No se pudo buscar en Pixonaut. Inténtalo de nuevo en un momento."

#. translators: Message in the blank search on the product edit page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Admin/CatalogueSearch.php:316
msgid "Connect the store to Pixonaut to search its catalogue."
msgstr "Conecta la tienda a Pixonaut para buscar en su catálogo."

#: src/Admin/ConnectionScreen.php:424
