msgstr "Plazo de la prueba de Pixonaut vencido"

#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:44
msgid ""
"Sent to the store when a customer did not answer the proof of their design "
"by the deadline, with what happened to the item."
msgstr ""
"Se envía a la tienda cuando un cliente no responde a la prueba de su diseño "
"dentro del plazo, con lo que pasó con el artículo."

#. translators: Default subject of the email to the merchant. {order_number}, {site_title} and similar in braces are filled in by WooCommerce; keep them as written.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:58
msgid "[{site_title}]: Proof deadline passed for order #{order_number}"
msgstr ""
"[{site_title}]: Plazo de la prueba vencido para el pedido #{order_number}"

#. translators: Default heading at the top of the email to the merchant. Text in braces is filled in by WooCommerce; keep it as written.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:63
msgid "Proof deadline passed for order #{order_number}"
msgstr "Plazo de la prueba vencido para el pedido #{order_number}"

#. translators: %s: why, as the store explains the item's attention reason.
#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:98
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The store could not decide its proof, so the item needs your attention. %s"
msgstr ""
"La tienda no pudo resolver su prueba, así que el artículo requiere tu "
"atención. %s"

#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:99
msgid ""
"Its design was approved as the proof shows it and is on its way to print."
msgstr ""
"Su diseño se aprobó tal como lo muestra la prueba y va camino a la impresión."

#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:100
msgid ""
"Its design was rejected, and the item cancelled and refunded. The customer "
"was told."
msgstr ""
"Su diseño se rechazó, y el artículo se canceló y se reembolsó. Se avisó al "
"cliente."

#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:101
msgid ""
"Its design was rejected and the item cancelled. The customer was told. "
"Refund it if you need to."
msgstr ""
"Su diseño se rechazó y el artículo se canceló. Se avisó al cliente. "
"Reembólsalo si es necesario."

#: src/Emails/DeadlinePassedEmail.php:102
msgid ""
"Its design was rejected and will not be printed. The item needs your "
"attention: refund or cancel it."
msgstr ""
"Su diseño se rechazó y no se imprimirá. El artículo requiere tu atención: "
"reembólsalo o cancélalo."

#. translators: Name of the email to the customer that confirms their approval, shown in WooCommerce > Settings > Emails.
#: src/Emails/DesignApprovedEmail.php:40
msgctxt "name of the design approved email in WooCommerce email settings"
msgid "Design approved"
msgstr "Diseño aprobado"

#: src/Emails/DesignApprovedEmail.php:41
msgid ""
"Sent to the customer when they approved the proof of their design, with "
"proof by email. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Se envía al cliente cuando aprueba la prueba de su diseño, con prueba por "
