#. translators: Name of this exporter in WordPress Tools > Export Personal Data, which the merchant reads.
#. translators: Heading of this group of data in the personal data export the customer receives.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataEraser.php:142
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:52
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:72
msgid "Personalised designs"
msgstr "Diseños personalizados"

#. translators: %s: order number.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataEraser.php:195
#, php-format
msgid "Personalised designs in order %s were retained with the order."
msgstr "Los diseños personalizados del pedido %s se conservaron con el pedido."

#. translators: %s: order number.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataEraser.php:197
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Personalised designs in order %s were retained: they are needed to fulfil "
"the order. They are erased once the order has shipped or been cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Los diseños personalizados del pedido %s se conservaron: son necesarios para "
"completar el pedido. Se borrarán cuando el pedido se haya enviado o "
"cancelado."

#. translators: %s: order number.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataEraser.php:199
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Personalised designs in order %s could not be erased yet. The store tries "
"again shortly."
msgstr ""
"Los diseños personalizados del pedido %s todavía no se pudieron borrar. La "
"tienda lo volverá a intentar en breve."

#. translators: %s: order number.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataEraser.php:201
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Personalised designs in order %s could not be erased. The order notes say "
"why."
msgstr ""
"Los diseños personalizados del pedido %s no se pudieron borrar. Las notas "
"del pedido explican por qué."

#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:73
msgid ""
"The personalised items of your orders, and the references under which their "
"designs and print orders are kept by our print service."
msgstr ""
"Los artículos personalizados de tus pedidos y las referencias con las que "
"nuestro servicio de impresión guarda sus diseños y pedidos de impresión."

#. translators: Label of a row in the personal data export the customer receives; the value is the order number.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:95
msgid "Order number"
msgstr "Número de pedido"

#. translators: Label of a row in the personal data export the customer receives; the value is the product name.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:100
msgid "Product"
msgstr "Producto"

#. translators: Label of a row in the personal data export the customer receives; the value is the ids of their designs in Pixonaut.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:114
msgid "Design IDs"
msgstr "ID de los diseños"

#. translators: Label of a row in the personal data export the customer receives; the value is the id of the order at the printshop.
#: src/Privacy/PersonalDataExporter.php:131
msgid "Print order ID"
msgstr "ID del pedido de impresión"

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:47
msgid ""
"We use Pixonaut to personalise and print the products you design in our "
"store."
msgstr ""
"Usamos Pixonaut para personalizar e imprimir los productos que diseñas en "
"nuestra tienda."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:48
msgid ""
"When you personalise a product, the text you type and the photos you upload "
"are sent to Pixonaut, which stores your design and makes its previews and "
"print files."
msgstr ""
"Cuando personalizas un producto, el texto que escribes y las fotos que subes "
"se envían a Pixonaut, que guarda tu diseño y genera sus vistas previas y "
"archivos de impresión."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:49
msgid ""
"When you order a personalised product, your name, email address, phone "
"number and shipping address are sent to Pixonaut and to the printshop that "
"prints and delivers it."
msgstr ""
"Cuando pides un producto personalizado, tu nombre, tu dirección de correo "
"electrónico, tu número de teléfono y tu dirección de envío se envían a "
"Pixonaut y a la imprenta que lo imprime y lo entrega."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:50
msgid ""
"Where the designer offers Pixel, Pixonaut's AI assistant, what you ask "
"Pixel, and the photos and design it works on, are sent to Pixonaut. Our "
"staff may also use Pixel to manage the store, which can include reading your "
"order and its details. Pixonaut processes what is sent to Pixel with AI "
"model providers."
msgstr ""
"Si el personalizador ofrece Pixel, el asistente de IA de Pixonaut, lo que le "
"preguntas a Pixel, así como las fotos y el diseño con los que trabaja, se "
"envían a Pixonaut. Nuestro personal también puede usar Pixel para gestionar "
"la tienda, lo que puede incluir leer tu pedido y sus detalles. Pixonaut "
"procesa lo que se envía a Pixel con proveedores de modelos de IA."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:51
msgid ""
"Pixonaut erases your design and delivery details a number of days after your "
"order is finished. When you ask us to erase your personal data, they are "
"erased sooner, unless we keep them with your order or still need them to "
"deliver it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut borra tu diseño y tus datos de envío un número determinado de días "
"después de que tu pedido se complete. Si nos pides que borremos tus datos "
"personales, se borran antes, salvo que los conservemos con tu pedido o aún "
"los necesitemos para entregarlo."

#. translators: 1: URL of Pixonaut's privacy policy, 2: URL of Pixonaut's list of sub-processors.
#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:54
#, php-format
msgid "Pixonaut privacy policy: %1$s. Pixonaut's sub-processors: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Política de privacidad de Pixonaut: %1$s. Subencargados del tratamiento de "
"Pixonaut: %2$s."

#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:60
msgid ""
"Personalised products are designed, proofed and printed through Pixonaut, so "
"the store sends Pixonaut the personal data below. Adapt this text to what "
"your store uses: leave out Pixel if you do not use it."
msgstr ""
"Los productos personalizados se diseñan, se aprueban mediante una prueba y "
"se imprimen a través de Pixonaut, por lo que la tienda envía a Pixonaut los "
"datos personales que se indican a continuación. Adapta este texto a lo que "
"usa tu tienda: quita Pixel si no lo usas."

#. translators: Label before the text WordPress suggests for the store's privacy policy.
#: src/Privacy/PolicyText.php:62
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr "Texto sugerido:"

#. translators: Error message of the proof REST route, shown to the shopper who opened a proof link.
#: src/Proofs/ProofRoute.php:131
msgid "This proof link is not valid."
msgstr "Este enlace de la prueba no es válido."

#. translators: Error message of the proof REST route, shown to the shopper who opened a proof link.
#: src/Proofs/ProofRoute.php:260
msgid "This proof is no longer available."
msgstr "Esta prueba ya no está disponible."

#. translators: Error message of the proof REST route, shown to the shopper who opened a proof link.
#: src/Proofs/ProofRoute.php:265
msgid "This proof cannot be shown right now."
msgstr "Esta prueba no se puede mostrar en este momento."

#. translators: 1: required PHP version, 2: current PHP version.
#: src/Requirements.php:67
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce needs PHP %1$s or newer. This site runs PHP %2$s, "
"so the plugin is not running."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce necesita PHP %1$s o posterior. Este sitio usa PHP "
"%2$s, así que el plugin no se está ejecutando."

#: src/Requirements.php:78
msgid ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce needs WooCommerce. Activate WooCommerce to use it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce necesita WooCommerce. Activa WooCommerce para "
"usarlo."

#. translators: 1: required WooCommerce version, 2: installed WooCommerce version.
#: src/Requirements.php:88
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce needs WooCommerce %1$s or newer. This site runs "
"WooCommerce %2$s, so the plugin is not running. Update WooCommerce to use it."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut for WooCommerce necesita WooCommerce %1$s o posterior. Este sitio "
"usa WooCommerce %2$s, así que el plugin no se está ejecutando. Actualiza "
"WooCommerce para usarlo."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:108
msgid "Default layout"
msgstr "Presentación predeterminada"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:109
msgid ""
"How personalised products show the designer, unless a product overrides it."
msgstr ""
"Cómo muestran el personalizador los productos personalizados, salvo que un "
"producto lo cambie."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:122
msgid "Designer language"
msgstr "Idioma del personalizador"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:123
msgid ""
"The language of the designer on the product page, of Pixonaut’s designer the "
"Personalise button opens, and of the proof pages customers approve their "
"designs on. Following the site shows each visitor the site’s language they "
"browse in when Pixonaut has it, and the workspace’s default language when it "
"does not."
msgstr ""
"El idioma del personalizador de la página del producto, del personalizador "
"de Pixonaut que abre el botón Personalizar y de las páginas de prueba en las "
"que los clientes aprueban sus diseños. Con “Idioma del sitio”, cada "
"visitante ve el idioma en el que navega por el sitio cuando Pixonaut lo "
"tiene y, si no, el idioma predeterminado del espacio de trabajo."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing how the product page designer lays out its form. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:136 templates/admin/product-fields.php:215
msgid "Form layout"
msgstr "Disposición del formulario"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:137
msgid ""
"How the designer lays out its form, on the product page and in Pixonaut’s "
"designer the Personalise button opens, unless a product overrides it: as the "
"template chose, every step on one page, or one step at a time."
msgstr ""
"Cómo dispone el personalizador su formulario, en la página del producto y en "
"el personalizador de Pixonaut que abre el botón Personalizar, salvo que un "
"producto lo cambie: según la plantilla, todos los pasos en una página o un "
"paso cada vez."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: each product option, such as Size or Colour, gets a group of its own in the designer's form.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:149
msgid "As its own group"
msgstr "Como grupo propio"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:150
msgid ""
"Puts each of a product's options, such as Size or Colour, in a group of its "
"own in the designer's form on the product page, named after the option, in "
"the product's attribute order. Off, the options stay on top of the form, "
"unnumbered. A product whose groups were arranged by hand keeps them."
msgstr ""
"Coloca cada opción de un producto, como Talla o Color, en un grupo propio "
"del formulario del personalizador en la página del producto, con el nombre "
"de la opción, en el orden de atributos del producto. Desactivado, las "
"opciones quedan arriba del formulario, sin número. Un producto cuyos grupos "
"se organizaron a mano los conserva."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: whether the groups of a product's options come before or after the template's groups.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:161
msgid "Place of the option groups"
msgstr "Posición de los grupos de opciones"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:162
msgid ""
"Whether the groups of a product's options come before or after the "
"template's groups."
msgstr ""
"Si los grupos de las opciones de un producto van antes o después de los "
"grupos de la plantilla."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: whether the designer's form numbers its groups.
#. translators: Label of the dropdown choosing whether the designer's form numbers its groups. Admin product page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:174 templates/admin/product-fields.php:220
msgid "Group numbers"
msgstr "Números de grupo"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:175
msgid ""
"Numbers the groups of the designer's form on the product page: 1 Photo, 2 "
"Text on one page, Step 1 of 2 in steps. Off shows the group names with no "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Numera los grupos del formulario del personalizador en la página del "
"producto: 1 Foto, 2 Texto en una página, Paso 1 de 2 por pasos. Desactivado, "
"muestra los nombres de los grupos sin número."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:186
msgid "Load other colours and views"
msgstr "Cargar otros colores y vistas"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:187
msgid ""
"Whether the designer loads a product's other colours, views and sides before "
"the customer picks one, so they show at once. Choose In the background or "
"Off for products with many large photos, or for customers mostly on phones."
msgstr ""
"Si el personalizador carga los demás colores, vistas y caras de un producto "
"antes de que el cliente elija uno, para que se muestren al instante. Elige "
"“En segundo plano” o “Desactivado” para productos con muchas fotos grandes o "
"para clientes que compran sobre todo desde el celular."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:200
msgid "Designer accent colour"
msgstr "Color de acento del personalizador"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:201
msgid ""
"The colour the designer on the product page marks the chosen view, colour "
"and option in, and draws its Next button in. None takes the accent colour of "
"the store's brand in Pixonaut, and keeps the designer's own colours when the "
"brand has none."
msgstr ""
"El color con el que el personalizador de la página del producto marca la "
"vista, el color y la opción elegidos, y con el que dibuja su botón "
"Siguiente. “Ninguno” toma el color de acento de la marca de la tienda en "
"Pixonaut y mantiene los colores propios del personalizador cuando la marca "
"no tiene ninguno."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:212
msgid "Custom accent colour"
msgstr "Color de acento personalizado"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:213
msgid ""
"The accent colour when Designer accent colour is A custom colour, e.g. "
"#1e73be."
msgstr ""
"El color de acento cuando “Color de acento del personalizador” es “Un color "
"personalizado”, p. ej., #1e73be."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:224
msgid "Show the print area's frame"
msgstr "Mostrar el marco del área de impresión"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:225
msgid ""
"Draws a thin grey frame on the preview around where the design can go, in "
"the designer on the product page and in Pixonaut's designer the Personalise "
"button opens. Off, the design sits on the product photo as it will be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"Dibuja un marco gris delgado en la vista previa alrededor de donde puede ir "
"el diseño, en el personalizador de la página del producto y en el "
"personalizador de Pixonaut que abre el botón Personalizar. Si se desactiva, "
"el diseño aparece sobre la foto del producto tal como se imprimirá."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant. "Hosted page" is Pixonaut's designer page the Personalise button opens.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:235
msgid "Add to cart after approve in hosted page"
msgstr "Agregar al carrito tras aprobar en la página alojada"

#. translators: Help text of a setting on the settings page. "Approve and add to cart" and "Approve and go back" are the labels of the button on Pixonaut's designer page.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:237
msgid ""
"For the Personalise button layout. Approving adds the product to the cart "
"and opens its cart item's page, and Pixonaut's designer says Approve and add "
"to cart. Off, approving returns to the product page, and it says Approve and "
"go back."
msgstr ""
"Para el diseño de página con el botón Personalizar. Al aprobar, el producto "
"se agrega al carrito y se abre la página de ese artículo del carrito, y el "
"personalizador de Pixonaut indica Aprobar y añadir al carrito. Desactivado, "
"al aprobar se vuelve a la página del producto, e indica Aprobar y volver."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: how the options of a product option such as a size show in the designer's form.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:248
msgid "Product options in the designer"
msgstr "Opciones del producto en el personalizador"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:249
msgid ""
"How the designer on the product page shows the options of a variable "
"product, such as its sizes, when it draws them in its form. As the theme "
"shows them (the default) keeps the theme's own field, and any swatches "
"another plugin draws in it. As swatches shows each option as a button like "
"the designer's own choices, an option that cannot be bought with the other "
"choices greyed out."
msgstr ""
"Cómo el personalizador de la página del producto muestra las opciones de un "
"producto variable, como sus tamaños, cuando las presenta en su formulario. "
"Como las muestra el tema (la opción predeterminada) mantiene el campo propio "
"del tema y los botones que otro plugin dibuje en él. Como botones muestra "
"cada opción como un botón, igual que las opciones propias del "
"personalizador. Una opción que no se puede comprar con las demás elecciones "
"aparece atenuada."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:261
msgid "Use Pixonaut pictures as product images"
msgstr "Usar las imágenes de Pixonaut como imágenes de producto"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:262
msgid ""
"Sets each personalised product’s and variation’s image to Pixonaut’s picture "
"of it, its template on the blank, and draws it again when the product "
"changes. A product can show its template’s showcase sets instead, chosen "
"under Product images in its Pixonaut tab. An image you set yourself is kept. "
"Off, each product gets back the image it had before."
msgstr ""
"Establece como imagen de cada producto y variación personalizados la imagen "
"de Pixonaut correspondiente, su plantilla sobre el producto base, y la "
"vuelve a generar cuando el producto cambia. Un producto puede mostrar en su "
"lugar los conjuntos de muestra de su plantilla, que se eligen en “Imágenes "
"de producto”, en su pestaña Pixonaut. Si estableces una imagen tú mismo, se "
"conserva. Si se desactiva, cada producto recupera la imagen que tenía antes."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the fields are the ones the customer filled in to personalise the item.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:272
msgid "List the design's fields"
msgstr "Mostrar los campos del diseño"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:273
msgid ""
"Lists what the customer filled in under a personalised item in the cart, the "
"checkout, their orders and the order emails, as the designer showed it. Off, "
"the item shows only its name. The order screen in the admin always lists "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Muestra lo que el cliente completó bajo un artículo personalizado en el "
"carrito, al finalizar la compra, en sus pedidos y en los correos "
"electrónicos del pedido, tal como lo mostraba el personalizador. "
"Desactivado, el artículo muestra solo su nombre. La pantalla del pedido en "
"la administración siempre los muestra."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant: which view of the product the picture of a personalised item shows.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:284
msgid "Picture shows"
msgstr "La imagen muestra"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:285
msgid ""
"A personalised item shows the customer’s design on the product in the cart, "
"the checkout, their orders and the order emails. This chooses the view of "
"the product it is drawn in: the one the customer previewed their design in, "
"or the first of the placement’s views the product is shown in."
msgstr ""
"Un artículo personalizado muestra el diseño del cliente sobre el producto en "
"el carrito, al finalizar la compra, en sus pedidos y en los correos "
"electrónicos del pedido. Aquí se elige en qué vista del producto se muestra: "
"la vista en la que el cliente previsualizó su diseño, o la primera de las "
"vistas de la ubicación en las que se muestra el producto."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:298
msgid "Default approval"
msgstr "Aprobación predeterminada"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:299
msgid ""
"How customers approve their design before it is printed, unless a product "
"overrides it."
msgstr ""
"Cómo aprueban los clientes su diseño antes de que se imprima, salvo que un "
"producto lo cambie."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:313
msgid "Proof approval deadline (days)"
msgstr "Plazo para aprobar la prueba (días)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:314
msgid ""
"With proof by email, how many days the customer has to approve their proof. "
"The link in the email works a week longer."
msgstr ""
"Con la prueba por correo electrónico, cuántos días tiene el cliente para "
"aprobar su prueba. El enlace del correo electrónico funciona una semana más."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:326
msgid "When no answer by the deadline"
msgstr "Si no hay respuesta dentro del plazo"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:327
msgid ""
"With proof by email, what happens to a design the customer neither approved "
"nor rejected by the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Con la prueba por correo electrónico, qué pasa con un diseño que el cliente "
"no ha aprobado ni rechazado dentro del plazo."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; what happens to an item whose design the customer rejected.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:340
msgid "On deny"
msgstr "Al rechazar"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:341
msgid ""
"What happens to an item whose design the customer rejected, or which was "
"denied at the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Qué pasa con un artículo cuyo diseño rechazó el cliente o que se rechazó al "
"vencer el plazo."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:355
msgid "First proof reminder after (days)"
msgstr "Primer recordatorio de la prueba tras (días)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:356
msgid ""
"Days after the proof email that a customer who has not answered is reminded. "
"Only reminders before the deadline are sent."
msgstr ""
"Días después del correo electrónico con la prueba en que se envía un "
"recordatorio al cliente que no ha respondido. Solo se envían los "
"recordatorios anteriores al plazo."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of days.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:369
msgid "Then remind every (days)"
msgstr "Después, recordar cada (días)"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:370
msgid "Days between one proof reminder and the next."
msgstr "Días entre un recordatorio de la prueba y el siguiente."

#. translators: Title of a setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the value is a number of reminders.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:383
msgid "Proof reminders at most"
msgstr "Máximo de recordatorios de la prueba"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:384
msgid ""
"How many reminders a customer gets at most; 0 sends none. The last one says "
"when the deadline is and what happens then."
msgstr ""
"Cuántos recordatorios recibe un cliente como máximo; 0 no envía ninguno. El "
"último indica cuándo vence el plazo y qué pasa entonces."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the Pixonaut API.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:402
msgid "API base"
msgstr "Base de la API"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:403
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut API as the browser reaches it, e.g. a local Pixonaut. Empty "
"uses Pixonaut’s own. The store’s key is sent to this address."
msgstr ""
"La API de Pixonaut tal como la alcanza el navegador, p. ej., un Pixonaut "
"local. Si se deja vacío, se usa la de Pixonaut. La clave de la tienda se "
"envía a esta dirección."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL WordPress uses for the Pixonaut API.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:412
msgid "Server-to-server API base"
msgstr "Base de la API de servidor a servidor"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:413
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut API as WordPress itself reaches it, when that differs from the "
"browser’s address (WordPress inside Docker, say). Empty uses the API base."
msgstr ""
"La API de Pixonaut tal como la alcanza el propio WordPress, cuando no "
"coincide con la dirección del navegador (por ejemplo, WordPress dentro de "
"Docker). Si se deja vacío, se usa la base de la API."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the Pixonaut studio.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:422
msgid "Studio base"
msgstr "Base del estudio"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:423
msgid ""
"The Pixonaut studio, where a connect is approved and the admin’s studio "
"links lead. Empty uses Pixonaut’s own."
msgstr ""
"El estudio de Pixonaut, donde se aprueba una conexión y adonde llevan los "
"enlaces al estudio de la administración. Si se deja vacío, se usa el de "
"Pixonaut."

#. translators: Title of a developer setting on the settings page, shown to the merchant; the base URL of the CDN the designer SDK loads from.
#: src/Settings/Settings.php:432
msgid "CDN base"
msgstr "Base del CDN"

#: src/Settings/Settings.php:433
